msgstr "一次融合中不同分数记录具有不同稳定并列序号。同分相关性仍并列，按此声明序号显示。 声明示例：gmeow:FusionStableTieOrderConstraint rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ScoreFoldBaseConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
